{
  "$comment": "Visual regression shots (tools/visual/run.mjs, docs/QUALITY.md 'Visual regression'). Each shot starts in a fresh browser context at 1920 x 1080 with Math.random seeded from `seed` (?seed= carries it for the game), the page clock fixed at `clock` and advanced only by the harness, and runs its UI steps; `setup` steps are the named in-page setups of tools/visual/setups.mjs. Shots of ?render=3d add `camera` (look-at point, floor, zoom); the rest of the pose is src/contracts/look.js. Adding a shot needs its first baseline, approved by someone other than the branch agent: node tools/visual/run.mjs --approve <id> --reason '...' --by review:<id>|integrator. Every tile of a 16 x 9 grid must also reach SSIM 0.95 (tools/visual/compare.mjs).",
